Task #114: Refund a renewal order: gateway refund, subscription effect, and emails
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Status:      todo
  Priority:    high
  Class:       standard
  Assignee:    --
  Tags:        admin, portal, day-09
  Due:         2026-08-11
  Estimate:    1h30m
