reference/SLT-REF-06-flexible-renewal-sync-segment-partition-math-meta-keys-first.md:175:Note the checkout-time gateway resolution: `arraysubs_get_current_renewal_sync_gateway_context()` (`renewal-sync-helpers.php:473-515`) reads `$_POST['payment_method']`, then the session's `chosen_payment_method`, then **falls back to the first available gateway** on a fresh checkout. **Switching the payment method radio on the checkout page re-prices the first charge**, so a segment/proration assertion must be made after explicitly selecting the gateway.
reference/SLT-REF-01-renewal-timeline-offsets-from-next-payment-date-order-sub-st.md:1:# SLT-REF-01 Renewal timeline: offsets from _next_payment_date, order/sub statuses, invoice lead
