+The admin subject is `[mirror-help.arrayhash.com] Subscription #12655 cancelled by SLT Core`, and the body says `Subscription #12655 from SLT Core has been cancelled.` This presents the affected customer as the cancelling actor even though the persisted actor is `system` and the cancellation reason is `Full refund processed`.
