+- Woo log `arraysubs-gateway-2026-08-11` records `charge.refunded → refund_created` for subscription `12655`, order `13590` at both gates.
+- Sanitized Stripe test API read returned HTTP `200`, `livemode=false`, charge amount/refunded amount `900/900`, `refunded=true`.
+- Exact succeeded refunds on the original charge:
+  - `re_3U2rFUJG5OzSNVs21cz3iqpg`, amount `400` cents, charge `ch_3U2rFUJG5OzSNVs21EkfnKxg`.
+  - `re_3U2rFUJG5OzSNVs21u0eb4ul`, amount `500` cents, charge `ch_3U2rFUJG5OzSNVs21EkfnKxg`.
+- No raw Stripe key or full card number was printed or persisted. Evidence screenshot: `/home/server-manager/slt-evidence/SLT-ADM-08-07-gateway-log.png`.
+
+## Portal and S5 preview
+
+- Customer portal `/my-account/view-subscription/12655/` showed `Cancelled`, end date `11 August, 2026 6:48 AM (UTC+6)`, order `13590` Refunded `$0.00`, and both exact Refund History rows (`$4.00` partial, `$5.00` full).
+- The portal note labels the same `_cancelled_by=system` event as `Canceled by Admin (admin)`, while the admin email labels it `cancelled by SLT Core`; this actor-provenance mismatch is filed below.
+- Portal evidence: `/home/server-manager/slt-evidence/SLT-ADM-08-05-history.png`.
+- S5 `12234` remained unchanged: active, seven completed payments, next `2026-08-11 07:50:13`, last `2026-08-10 11:44:06`, no refund/end/cancel meta.
+- S5's detail page exposed no **Prorated Refund** button or text, so the amount/days/cycle modal could not be opened. Renewal order `13593` has correct order-level `_subscription_id=12234` and `_subscription_renewal=12234`, but empty `_arraysubs_subscription_id`.
+- S5 was not mutated. Evidence: `/home/server-manager/slt-evidence/SLT-ADM-08-06-preview.png`.
+
+## Isolation and registry handoff
+
+- HPOS refund rows created after the task baseline are exactly `13729` and `13732`, both parented only to order `13590`; their absolute total is `$9.00`.
+- No other order received a task refund. S5 remained unchanged. No setting was written.
+- Registry page `11847` was append-only updated once with marker `SLT-ADM-08 D09 EARLY TERMINAL`; before/after SHA-256 values were `4f4e16f221b067151953acffd18227e0d99f3e87c3e8521b549d2594f4d2e4cb` and `ef2e75df76da0a34be5ca016db1ae50c88510590eed309c1ef543b39969e59f1`, marker occurrence exactly one.
+- D10 `SLT-SETUP-99A` must skip subscription `12655`; D11/D12 expect no renewal action, renewal order, or lifecycle mail after `2026-08-11 00:48:43Z`.
+
+## Verdict and standalone findings
+
+Overall `FAIL`: both gateway refunds, the partial/full subscription effects, cancellation emails, portal history, scheduler cleanup, and Stripe settlement passed. The authored S5 preview criterion failed because its control was absent. Two additional correctness/UX findings were observed.
+
+- `issues/SLT-ADM-08-prorated-refund-control-missing.md`
+- `issues/SLT-ADM-08-refund-button-amount-stays-zero.md`
+- `issues/SLT-ADM-08-admin-cancellation-misattributed-to-customer.md`
