- woocommerce-gateway-stripe: one ERROR in the sole extant dated file (2026-08-03), for order 12131. It is the Alipay/setup_future_usage invalid-request error already fully filed at issues/SLT-REN-03-subscription-checkout-offers-incompatible-alipay.md; no duplicate issue was created. Provider dashboard/account/request diagnostics are redacted in this evidence copy.
