## Method

For each subscription, the relationship-owned order set is the union of its numeric
`_parent_order_id`, decoded `_order_ids`, and HPOS orders carrying exact order meta
`_subscription_id=<sub>` or `_subscription_renewal=<sub>`. An order contributes one
historically paid positive cycle when it is a `shop_order`, has total greater than zero,
and its status is `wc-processing`, `wc-completed`, or `wc-refunded`. The refunded status
is deliberately included because the payment completed before the later refund.
`shop_order_refund` children, non-positive totals, and unpaid statuses do not contribute.

`delta = _completed_payments - historically paid positive-total order count`.

