+- `View Order` on exact highest-cycle renewal `13610` opened HPOS route `/wp-admin/admin.php?page=wc-orders&action=edit&id=13610`.
+- Stripe gateway card showed Connected, Visa ending `4242`, expiry `12/2034`, customer `cus_UzycTV6jaFimRK`, last transaction `ch_3U2vH5JG5OzSNVs21opBHJ6z`; neither field was an external Stripe-dashboard link.
