+
+## Task / date / plan
+
+- Date found: `2026-08-11`
+- Watch day: `D09`
+- Originating task: card `#114` / `SLT-ADM-08`
+- Plan file: `qa/subscription-lifecycle-test/kanban/tasks/114-refund-a-renewal-order-gateway-refund-subscription.md`
+
+## Affected IDs
